The LEAP protocol client (src/leap/) is an independent JavaScript
implementation whose design, protocol knowledge and public pairing
certificates (the "LAP" client certificate, its key and the Lutron
authorities, in src/leap/assets.js) come from pylutron-caseta:

  pylutron-caseta
  https://github.com/gurumitts/pylutron-caseta
  Copyright the pylutron-caseta contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The LEAP answers used as test fixtures (test/fixtures/pylutron/) are copied
from the tests of pylutron-caseta. The Pico button numbers per model
(src/leap/picoModels.js) follow the tables of the Home Assistant
lutron_caseta integration (https://github.com/home-assistant/core,
Apache-2.0).

No code of lutron-leap (GPL-3.0) is used or copied.

